      "generatedAt": "2026-11-06",
      "evidence": "Codex native ImageGen output exec-157f6e05-5c1a-44ed-9d43-84736a4ad944.png; untouched Emerald Cartridge source selected from the green-S/grey-W app-icon concept. Exact model was not disclosed."
